# Variant check: full Rao variational MOC (rao-bvp) solve with flow-field
# render and construction diagrams, on the 13 kN sea-level benchmark
# operating point.
#
# Companion to examples/cli/test_13kn_sealevel_regen_allstl.args — that file
# owns the authoritative Bezier/TOP-chart export benchmark; --flowfield (and
# the kernel_fan / rao_topology / bde_mesh construction diagrams plus the
# characteristic-crossing CSV) require --contour-method rao-bvp and live
# here.  Expect minutes of JAX BVP runtime; non-convergence exits nonzero
# (no --allow-unconverged).
#
#   PYTHONPATH=. python -m raosim @examples/cli/test_13kn_rao_bvp_flowfield.args

--no-banner

# Operating point (same as main benchmark; provenance documented there).
--propellant LOX/RP-1
--oxidizer LOX
--fuel RP-1
--pc 3.0e6
--target-thrust 13000
--epsilon 4.524
--pa-over-p0 0.033775
--length-pct 80

# Chamber and throat (same as main benchmark).
--l-star 1.0
--contraction-ratio 3.0
--minimum-cylindrical-length 0.03
--ru-factor 1.5

# Full variational MOC: rao-bvp contour, benchmark resolution and solve
# budget, JAX backend default.
--contour-method rao-bvp
--max-nfev 4000
--n-control 24
--n-kernel 24

# Flow-field render (Mach/pressure/flow-angle/temperature contours) — the rao-bvp
# solve also stashes the BDE construction diagnostics, so kernel_fan.png,
# rao_topology.png, bde_mesh.png and the MOC crossing-sample CSV are written.
--flowfield

--out builds/tests/13kn_rao_bvp_flowfield
